        "statement": "Overall, our strategy and business model are built around the key principle of, “If you succeed, we succeed.” While operationally the Company has developed core competencies in marketing and enrollment management, the success of the business is not based solely on recruiting students but rather retaining students through the program to graduation and facilitating their transition to employment in their field of study.",
